In trapezoid <imath>ABCD</imath>, angles <imath>B</imath> and <imath>C</imath> measure <imath>60^\circ</imath> and <imath>AB = DC</imath>. The side lengths are all positive integers, and the perimeter of <imath>ABCD</imath> is <imath>30</imath> units. How many non-congruent trapezoids satisfy all of these conditions?

<asy>
