In quadrilateral <imath> ABCD</imath>, sides <imath> \overline{AB}</imath> and <imath> \overline{BC}</imath> both have length 10, sides <imath> \overline{CD}</imath> and <imath> \overline{DA}</imath> both have length 17, and the measure of angle <imath> ADC</imath> is <imath> 60^\circ</imath>. What is the length of diagonal <imath> \overline{AC}</imath>?
